      "id": "claim_379407c8bc4349538b7a77fc5ccb3497",
      "statement": "Staging deploy triggers on push to main, on a PR being labeled `staging`, on pushes to a PR that already carries the label, on unlabeling (which resets staging to main HEAD), and on manual dispatch (which deploys main HEAD); docs/markdown-only changes are path-ignored. Images are tagged main-<sha7> or pr-<n>-<sha7>, and runs are serialized in the `staging-deploy` concurrency group without cancellation.",
      "evidence": [
