      "statement": "On staging, when a different PR previously held the staging label (or its label was removed), a rollback-plan job derives per-app targets from the highest-numbered migration on main, and the deploy job runs `manage.py migrate <app> <target>` in the still-running backend container before syncing the checkout and pulling new images; the previous PR then has its label removed and is commented on.",
