      "statement": "Staging deploy job only runs when both builds succeeded and rollback-plan succeeded or was skipped; it SSHes to the host, checks out the deploy ref, exports REGISTRY and the four image tag variables, runs `docker compose -f docker-compose.staging.yml pull` and `up -d`, then executes scripts/post-deploy.sh in the backend container.",
