      "statement": "Production deploy is manual-only, always deploys main HEAD tagged prod-<sha7>, and a ci-gate job blocks all builds unless every check run on that commit (excluding the workflow's own suite) is complete and successful/skipped/neutral; the build and deploy jobs run in the `production` environment. It has no migration rollback step; deploy runs git checkout, compose pull/up -d with the default docker-compose.yml, then post-deploy.sh.",
